WEBVTT

00:00:19.120 --> 00:00:20.500
Tooru!

00:00:22.080 --> 00:00:24.040
Run-chan! Gosh...

00:00:27.290 --> 00:00:28.750
What is it?

00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:33.090
Thank you, Tooru!

00:00:36.430 --> 00:00:37.390
Right...

00:02:47.520 --> 00:02:48.640
Morning!

00:02:48.640 --> 00:02:49.690
Good morning!

00:02:49.690 --> 00:02:51.690
Oh! Morning!

00:02:51.690 --> 00:02:53.360
Another cold day today.

00:02:53.360 --> 00:02:56.230
Ah, won't spring come sooner?

00:02:56.230 --> 00:02:59.860
Oh, come to think of it, isn't Tooru's birthday coming up?

00:02:59.860 --> 00:03:01.860
Yup, it is!

00:03:01.860 --> 00:03:03.870
Then should we throw a party?

00:03:03.870 --> 00:03:05.740
I'm okay without one.

00:03:05.740 --> 00:03:07.700
But I insist!

00:03:07.930 --> 00:03:10.750
Look forward to the present I'm getting you this year!

00:03:10.750 --> 00:03:11.670
Okay.

00:03:11.670 --> 00:03:13.630
<i>Look forward to it?</i>

00:03:14.250 --> 00:03:15.840
<i>Don't tell me it's that again.</i>

00:03:16.300 --> 00:03:19.090
<i>What kind of animal was that, anyway?</i>

00:03:23.640 --> 00:03:25.810
Those uniforms...

00:03:25.810 --> 00:03:27.850
Oh, they must be middle schoolers.

00:03:28.020 --> 00:03:30.350
There's a school open house going on today.

00:03:31.060 --> 00:03:32.600
Oh, that explains it.

00:03:32.810 --> 00:03:36.270
After the New Year, it's exams for them, isn't it?

00:03:36.270 --> 00:03:39.490
And we'll be yet another year older.

00:03:40.700 --> 00:03:41.900
Exams...

00:03:42.570 --> 00:03:46.080
Exams, huh? Brings back memories, right, Tooru?

00:03:46.080 --> 00:03:46.830
Huh?

00:03:47.410 --> 00:03:48.450
Yeah.

00:03:52.710 --> 00:03:53.460
"First choice: 2nd High"

00:03:53.460 --> 00:03:54.920
Ah...

00:03:54.920 --> 00:03:58.050
Gotta figure out my second choice school soon.

00:03:58.050 --> 00:04:00.550
So you've figured out your first choice?

00:04:00.550 --> 00:04:05.430
Yeah. With my grades, I figured this place is about right.

00:04:06.350 --> 00:04:08.390
Tooru, what will you do for high school?

00:04:08.390 --> 00:04:11.680
Haven't decided? You're still in second year, after all.

00:04:11.680 --> 00:04:13.560
I'll aim for wherever you go.

00:04:13.560 --> 00:04:15.310
You mean 2nd High?

00:04:15.310 --> 00:04:19.440
With your grades, I'm sure you could get in somewhere better, Tooru.

00:04:19.440 --> 00:04:20.070
No...

00:04:20.310 --> 00:04:22.700
Anywhere you go, I'll go too.

00:04:27.830 --> 00:04:28.410
Here.

00:04:28.870 --> 00:04:29.950
Thanks!

00:04:29.950 --> 00:04:33.580
So, have you decided on a high school?

00:04:33.580 --> 00:04:36.080
Well, you could say that.

00:04:36.380 --> 00:04:38.380
How does 2nd High sound?

00:04:38.380 --> 00:04:41.760
Oh my. That sounds wonderful. They have a good reputation, too.

00:04:41.960 --> 00:04:44.550
Your class rank's about right for there, isn't it?

00:04:44.550 --> 00:04:45.550
Yeah.

00:04:45.550 --> 00:04:46.010
Ah,

00:04:46.390 --> 00:04:51.350
speaking of which, Tooru said she'd aim for whatever school I get into.

00:04:52.020 --> 00:04:52.770
Huh?

00:04:52.770 --> 00:04:55.140
Apply for a better school.

00:04:55.140 --> 00:04:56.270
B-But...

00:04:56.520 --> 00:04:59.360
It will make your life easier in the future.

00:04:59.360 --> 00:05:01.440
Didn't you just say 2nd High was wonderf-

00:05:01.440 --> 00:05:02.650
I CHANGED MY MIND.

00:05:02.650 --> 00:05:03.950
What?

00:05:04.260 --> 00:05:08.660
But we both know how I'd do on the entrance exams.

00:05:09.370 --> 00:05:11.700
My class rank isn't good enough, either.

00:05:11.700 --> 00:05:12.950
You're right.

00:05:13.450 --> 00:05:15.080
Not at the moment, it isn't.

00:05:15.710 --> 00:05:17.330
Ah! Wait!

00:05:17.750 --> 00:05:19.290
Who are you calling?

00:05:19.290 --> 00:05:19.960
A cram school.

00:05:19.960 --> 00:05:21.630
Noooo!

00:05:29.140 --> 00:05:31.810
All right, I understand.

00:05:31.810 --> 00:05:34.850
We won't get anywhere if I force you to go.

00:05:35.890 --> 00:05:36.520
So.

00:05:40.480 --> 00:05:43.320
How about all the Kobe beef you can eat?

00:05:45.360 --> 00:05:47.150
Got it! I'll give it a shot!

00:05:48.280 --> 00:05:49.990
Really?

00:05:49.990 --> 00:05:53.240
So you're applying to a better school, Run-chan?

00:05:53.240 --> 00:05:54.750
It looks like I am.

00:05:54.750 --> 00:05:57.620
I talked it over with my mom.

00:05:57.620 --> 00:06:00.420
So you're going to cram school, and getting a private tutor.

00:06:00.420 --> 00:06:02.750
You're really motivated!

00:06:02.750 --> 00:06:05.720
The private tutor's someone you know, Hira-chan!

00:06:05.720 --> 00:06:06.220
Really?

00:06:06.220 --> 00:06:07.260
Look!

00:06:13.180 --> 00:06:16.430
Allow me to introduce! Meet Tooru-sensei!

00:06:16.430 --> 00:06:17.060
Greetings.

00:06:17.060 --> 00:06:19.060
But...

00:06:19.060 --> 00:06:21.360
Isn't Tooru-chan...

00:06:21.360 --> 00:06:23.270
Yep, you're right.

00:06:23.270 --> 00:06:26.440
But come on, you can't have a teacher without the glasses!

00:06:26.440 --> 00:06:29.570
I wasn't talking about the glasses...

00:06:30.870 --> 00:06:32.830
Then let us begin studying.

00:06:32.830 --> 00:06:34.490
All right!

00:06:34.490 --> 00:06:37.000
Let's start with the easy stuff.

00:06:37.000 --> 00:06:39.290
All right!

00:06:45.210 --> 00:06:46.010
Huh?

00:06:51.590 --> 00:06:54.010
For starters. Memorize these. All of them.

00:06:56.220 --> 00:06:58.270
They're the basics. It's just rote memorization.

00:06:58.560 --> 00:07:01.020
T-That's quite the stack...

00:07:11.910 --> 00:07:13.370
Jenga!

00:07:29.420 --> 00:07:30.930
The answer is A!

00:07:31.880 --> 00:07:33.550
Is what they're tricking you into thinking!

00:07:33.550 --> 00:07:34.760
Be careful!

00:07:35.510 --> 00:07:39.310
<i>What is this voice? It speaks straight into my mind!</i>

00:07:42.310 --> 00:07:45.940
<i>My right arm is writing answers, even though I'm not controlling it!</i>

00:07:46.570 --> 00:07:48.400
<i>What's happening?</i>

00:07:52.320 --> 00:07:53.410
<i>Huh?</i>

00:07:55.200 --> 00:07:56.410
<i>A dream?</i>

00:08:02.790 --> 00:08:04.080
Oh no! The words!

00:08:04.500 --> 00:08:05.630
Wait up!

00:08:06.000 --> 00:08:09.460
I won't be able to solve the problems like this!

00:08:11.760 --> 00:08:12.760
Huh?

00:08:15.010 --> 00:08:16.720
Run-chan. Wake up.

00:08:23.190 --> 00:08:24.270
A dream?

00:08:24.270 --> 00:08:25.060
Yes.

00:08:55.130 --> 00:08:56.010
Wow!

00:08:56.640 --> 00:08:58.220
Your grades got better!

00:09:00.720 --> 00:09:04.310
I've been reading study books every waking moment!

00:09:04.310 --> 00:09:05.730
I see.

00:09:07.860 --> 00:09:11.780
<i>So much that the books all ended up this ragged...</i>

00:09:11.780 --> 00:09:13.070
Oh, my bad.

00:09:13.440 --> 00:09:15.820
I dropped them in the bath...

00:09:15.820 --> 00:09:17.990
What? All of them?

00:09:17.990 --> 00:09:19.870
I'll buy you new ones.

00:09:23.040 --> 00:09:25.960
Well, I'm off now!

00:09:28.420 --> 00:09:31.000
<i>Run-chan, go for it!</i>

00:09:36.970 --> 00:09:38.390
Okay then!

00:09:38.390 --> 00:09:42.600
When the bell rings, flip over your test sheets and begin!

00:09:43.390 --> 00:09:45.520
<i>Here I go!</i>

00:09:45.520 --> 00:09:46.390
Begin!

00:09:53.320 --> 00:09:55.950
Oops. On to the next pencil.

00:09:58.450 --> 00:10:00.410
<i>Tokyo is a scary place!</i>

00:10:02.700 --> 00:10:06.540
Okay! I'm coming to collect your answer sheets!

00:10:09.750 --> 00:10:11.040
Excuse me...

00:10:11.040 --> 00:10:15.380
Sorry about earlier. Did that pencil point fly at you?

00:10:15.380 --> 00:10:17.930
Huh? Oh, no, it's okay.

00:10:17.930 --> 00:10:19.590
Oh, that's good to hear.

00:10:19.590 --> 00:10:21.260
<i>So it wasn't sabotage.</i>

00:10:23.060 --> 00:10:27.060
Oh? So you came all the way from Kansai to take the exam?

00:10:27.060 --> 00:10:30.600
Yeah. We're moving here this spring, so...

00:10:30.600 --> 00:10:32.690
Oh! Speaking of Kansai...

00:10:38.950 --> 00:10:41.700
This is my lucky charm for today!

00:10:41.700 --> 00:10:44.740
Really? To the God of Cows or something?

00:10:56.880 --> 00:11:00.510
I did it! It's there! It's right there!

00:11:00.930 --> 00:11:02.640
Look! My number's up there!

00:11:02.930 --> 00:11:05.640
I passed thanks to you, Tooru.

00:11:06.270 --> 00:11:09.310
No you didn't. It was your own effort, Run-chan.

00:11:09.640 --> 00:11:11.020
Congratulations.

00:11:14.360 --> 00:11:18.030
And so, I somehow managed to pass.

00:11:18.030 --> 00:11:19.570
Wow.

00:11:19.570 --> 00:11:21.610
Run, you really gave your all, didn't you?

00:11:21.820 --> 00:11:25.030
I'd write vocabulary on my hands, so I wouldn't forget them.

00:11:25.030 --> 00:11:29.160
Ah, I sometimes write things on my hand so I don't forget, too.

00:11:29.460 --> 00:11:32.670
On a test, that would be cheating, though.

00:11:32.670 --> 00:11:35.290
Well, of course I washed them off for the test.

00:11:35.670 --> 00:11:39.220
But I got into the habit and wrote things all over my body,

00:11:39.220 --> 00:11:41.220
so it was a pain to get it all off.

00:11:43.510 --> 00:11:45.100
Morning.

00:11:45.100 --> 00:11:46.010
Good morning.

00:11:46.680 --> 00:11:48.890
They announce test results today, don't they?

00:11:48.890 --> 00:11:51.310
Won't they have posted them already by now?

00:11:51.310 --> 00:11:52.390
Hmm...

00:11:52.390 --> 00:11:53.850
I'll go later.

00:11:53.850 --> 00:11:56.520
You're certainly taking it easy.

00:11:56.820 --> 00:11:58.860
I wouldn't be able to see anyway.

00:12:16.460 --> 00:12:17.460
Coming!

00:12:20.460 --> 00:12:23.510
I've got a present for you today, Tooru!

00:12:23.510 --> 00:12:24.340
Really?

00:12:24.930 --> 00:12:28.010
Here! Seeing as your birthday's coming up.

00:12:29.640 --> 00:12:30.600
Is it cake?

00:12:30.600 --> 00:12:31.730
It's cake!

00:12:38.730 --> 00:12:41.150
Well, three second rule, as they say.

00:12:41.150 --> 00:12:43.740
Um... but it fell totally upside down.

00:12:44.030 --> 00:12:45.570
Just kidding!

00:12:47.240 --> 00:12:49.870
Ta-dah! This is the real one.

00:12:49.870 --> 00:12:50.370
What?!

00:12:50.370 --> 00:12:51.660
Did I surprise you?

00:12:52.080 --> 00:12:56.670
They say you feel twice as happy if your hopes are lowered first!

00:12:56.670 --> 00:12:59.550
I wanted you to be happy, Tooru.

00:12:59.550 --> 00:13:01.420
Who told you that?

00:13:02.340 --> 00:13:04.010
I'll carry the cake.

00:13:04.380 --> 00:13:07.300
Don't worry, I won't drop it again.

00:13:07.680 --> 00:13:08.760
Just give it.

00:13:08.760 --> 00:13:11.180
But I couldn't make you carry my stuff...

00:13:11.390 --> 00:13:12.680
Just give it.

00:13:13.100 --> 00:13:15.310
Tooru, are you mad?

00:13:17.020 --> 00:13:20.190
Tooru, you're turning 16, aren't you?

00:13:20.190 --> 00:13:22.190
You've gotten so big!

00:13:22.190 --> 00:13:24.740
You used to be so tiny.

00:13:24.740 --> 00:13:25.450
Huh?

00:13:25.950 --> 00:13:28.870
Crawling on the ground after me...

00:13:28.870 --> 00:13:29.700
Huh?

00:13:29.700 --> 00:13:32.700
Always crying if you didn't have candy in your hand...

00:13:32.700 --> 00:13:35.410
You were so cute back then!

00:13:35.750 --> 00:13:36.580
Run-chan.

00:13:36.580 --> 00:13:37.710
Huh?

00:13:37.960 --> 00:13:39.840
What are you talking about?

00:13:39.840 --> 00:13:42.920
Huh? It was in a dream I had the other day.

00:13:42.920 --> 00:13:43.800
A dream?

00:13:44.510 --> 00:13:49.550
Look how tall you've gotten! Still tiny as ever, though.

00:13:52.260 --> 00:13:54.600
Don't treat me like a kid.

00:13:59.730 --> 00:14:01.230
Found a white hair!

00:14:06.360 --> 00:14:09.320
That's pretty daring, bringing a cake to school.

00:14:09.530 --> 00:14:12.370
There's a piece for everyone, so we can eat it at lunch!

00:14:12.370 --> 00:14:14.450
Where should we leave it until lunch?

00:14:14.620 --> 00:14:18.000
Oh yeah! We'll need a refrigerator.

00:14:18.000 --> 00:14:20.250
But there aren't any at school.

00:14:20.250 --> 00:14:23.340
Where would be the coldest place in school?

00:14:23.840 --> 00:14:25.670
The bathroom?

00:14:26.550 --> 00:14:28.510
You're eating this too, you know.

00:14:29.470 --> 00:14:32.260
On that note, Tooru's birthday's coming up, is it?

00:14:32.260 --> 00:14:34.220
A happy occasion!

00:14:35.060 --> 00:14:36.810
So what will you do for that?

00:14:37.060 --> 00:14:41.400
Don't worry. I've got a present ready for her actual birthday.

00:14:41.400 --> 00:14:46.070
I see. Well, I'll buy you that book you wanted, Tooru.

00:14:46.400 --> 00:14:47.360
Thanks.

00:14:47.360 --> 00:14:49.360
And... I'll get you...

00:14:50.320 --> 00:14:51.240
Cups.

00:14:51.740 --> 00:14:53.450
Cups? What kind?

00:14:56.160 --> 00:14:57.660
E cups.

00:14:57.660 --> 00:14:59.330
Wha... What?

00:15:00.580 --> 00:15:04.000
Come on, let's eat the cake already, before it goes bad!

00:15:04.250 --> 00:15:05.500
Sounds like a plan.

00:15:08.300 --> 00:15:09.800
Oooh!

00:15:10.180 --> 00:15:11.300
Nice!

00:15:11.300 --> 00:15:12.510
Looks good!

00:15:12.510 --> 00:15:13.760
A heart-pounding game!

00:15:13.760 --> 00:15:14.140
Huh?

00:15:14.390 --> 00:15:17.520
One of these is actually a wasabi-filled cake!

00:15:17.850 --> 00:15:20.270
Can't you celebrate normally?

00:15:20.850 --> 00:15:23.440
Also, one of them is obviously green.

00:15:23.440 --> 00:15:24.770
That's no secret at all.

00:15:30.700 --> 00:15:32.820
Yuuko, you get the best job.

00:15:32.820 --> 00:15:34.030
What?!

00:15:34.030 --> 00:15:35.530
She is from Kansai.

00:15:35.530 --> 00:15:37.040
How I envy her.

00:15:39.410 --> 00:15:41.120
Shall we dig in?

00:15:43.330 --> 00:15:48.460
But be prepared. There was actually one more wasabi cake-

00:15:49.970 --> 00:15:50.880
Run-chan!

00:15:54.300 --> 00:15:56.720
This cake is so cute.

00:16:03.730 --> 00:16:05.650
Oh, a commemorative picture?

00:16:05.650 --> 00:16:07.650
H-How nice.

00:16:07.650 --> 00:16:09.740
Let's take one together, for the occasion.

00:16:09.740 --> 00:16:10.820
Okay then.

00:16:17.240 --> 00:16:18.910
Yuuko, you're blurry.

00:16:18.910 --> 00:16:19.830
Huh?

00:16:20.250 --> 00:16:22.370
But I wasn't even moving.

00:16:22.370 --> 00:16:24.500
Maybe you twitched a tiny bit.

00:16:24.500 --> 00:16:26.630
Once more, to get it right!

00:16:26.630 --> 00:16:28.550
Then let's all match Yuuko.

00:16:32.170 --> 00:16:34.680
Hey! Do it normally!

00:16:35.640 --> 00:16:37.680
I moved! One more!

00:16:37.680 --> 00:16:39.890
Then let's match Yuuko again.

00:16:39.890 --> 00:16:41.060
Ready, and...

00:16:41.430 --> 00:16:43.560
Ah, I moved again!

00:16:45.100 --> 00:16:46.520
Geez!

00:16:49.400 --> 00:16:51.990
Okay! Continuing from yesterday.

00:17:03.120 --> 00:17:04.210
<i>Toorun?</i>

00:17:06.630 --> 00:17:07.750
<i>Cake!</i>

00:17:07.750 --> 00:17:11.380
<i>T-This must mean... um... um... um...</i>

00:17:18.300 --> 00:17:20.100
Toorun! Toorun!

00:17:24.350 --> 00:17:26.520
<i>Happy birthday!</i>

00:17:35.990 --> 00:17:37.110
Whaaat?

00:17:37.360 --> 00:17:40.160
Okay then, Yutaka-san! Solve this problem.

00:17:40.160 --> 00:17:42.160
Whaaaat?

00:17:47.920 --> 00:17:50.000
Here, take a look!

00:17:51.040 --> 00:17:52.750
Huh? What's this?

00:17:52.920 --> 00:17:56.130
A picture from when I was studying for exams!

00:17:56.130 --> 00:17:57.510
Oh, from two years ago?

00:17:57.760 --> 00:17:59.510
You're eating cake.

00:17:59.510 --> 00:18:02.850
Yup. It was Tooru's birthday that day.

00:18:02.850 --> 00:18:05.060
Why are you being fed?

00:18:05.430 --> 00:18:08.770
That's what being an exam student entails!

00:18:09.020 --> 00:18:10.730
Just kidding!

00:18:10.730 --> 00:18:11.360
Here.

00:18:11.360 --> 00:18:13.530
Happy birthday, Tooru!

00:18:13.530 --> 00:18:13.900
Huh?

00:18:14.610 --> 00:18:17.530
But you didn't forget her present.

00:18:17.900 --> 00:18:20.200
Yup. Even if I forgot everything else.

00:18:20.530 --> 00:18:22.280
Also...

00:18:22.280 --> 00:18:23.080
Look.

00:18:23.080 --> 00:18:24.290
Oh? What's this?

00:18:24.700 --> 00:18:27.290
This was Tooru's birthday last year.

00:18:27.830 --> 00:18:30.170
When it was her turn for exams, huh?

00:18:30.170 --> 00:18:31.040
You got it.

00:18:31.290 --> 00:18:37.170
Tooru said not to bother since she had exams, but I wanted to at least get her cake and a present.

00:18:37.970 --> 00:18:40.140
Weren't you bothering her?

00:18:40.140 --> 00:18:44.180
Oh, of course I wasn't. Right, Tooru?

00:18:45.680 --> 00:18:47.560
Tooru, you gave it your all too, right?

00:18:48.890 --> 00:18:50.350
And then...

00:18:51.190 --> 00:18:55.730
Ta-dah! Here's this year's commemorative picture!

00:18:58.530 --> 00:19:00.570
Hey, what's with that picture?

00:19:00.570 --> 00:19:02.570
Tooru sent it to me!

00:19:04.240 --> 00:19:06.330
Hey! Honestly...

00:19:06.870 --> 00:19:08.040
Let's go, Tooru.

00:19:08.290 --> 00:19:08.910
Okay.

00:19:09.330 --> 00:19:10.710
Hey!

00:20:13.690 --> 00:20:14.810
Hey, Tooru.

00:20:14.810 --> 00:20:17.570
Let's eat cake together next year, too!

00:20:17.570 --> 00:20:20.070
Spare me the wasabi cake, please.

00:20:20.070 --> 00:20:23.320
Hold your horses. We've got exams next year.

00:20:23.320 --> 00:20:26.700
Gosh, Nagi, don't mention scary things like that!

00:20:26.830 --> 00:20:28.080
What do you mean?

00:20:28.080 --> 00:20:29.700
That's reality for you.

00:20:29.700 --> 00:20:34.080
That's right. We'll have exams this time next year, won't we?

00:20:46.300 --> 00:20:47.640
Exams.

00:20:49.850 --> 00:20:51.680
We're heading this way today.

00:20:52.100 --> 00:20:53.730
Bye-bye!

00:20:57.150 --> 00:20:59.570
Time just flew by, didn't it?

00:20:59.570 --> 00:21:02.070
It feels like you entered our school just yesterday,

00:21:02.070 --> 00:21:04.780
but you're becoming a second-year already.

00:21:04.780 --> 00:21:06.160
That's right...

00:21:07.160 --> 00:21:10.450
<i>And Run-chan will be a third-year...</i>

00:21:53.160 --> 00:21:54.160
Tooru?

00:21:55.910 --> 00:21:57.460
What's up?

00:22:03.380 --> 00:22:04.710
Nothing.

00:22:04.710 --> 00:22:05.720
Really?

00:22:05.720 --> 00:22:06.550
Yeah.

00:22:07.300 --> 00:22:08.930
By the way, Run-chan.

00:22:09.220 --> 00:22:09.890
Huh?

00:22:10.100 --> 00:22:13.350
It's rather late of me to ask, but why'd you switch to this school?

00:22:14.180 --> 00:22:15.850
Why do you think?

00:22:15.850 --> 00:22:16.810
Tell me.

00:22:16.810 --> 00:22:19.060
It's a se-cret!

00:22:19.060 --> 00:22:20.400
Come on...

00:23:56.900 --> 00:23:57.990
Aliens?

00:23:57.990 --> 00:23:59.100
Aliens.

00:23:59.100 --> 00:24:01.840
Someone who came to correct the
mistakes humans make in this time period?

00:24:01.840 --> 00:24:03.410
That's a time traveller.

00:24:03.410 --> 00:24:05.240
Pithecanthropus Erectus.

00:24:05.240 --> 00:24:07.380
Now it's known as Homo Erectus.

00:24:07.380 --> 00:24:08.760
Wait, that's a primitive man?

00:24:08.760 --> 00:24:12.050
All the way to the end, Miporin is the only one that gets to respond to my jokes!

00:24:12.050 --> 00:24:14.050
That doesn't make me happy at all.

00:24:14.050 --> 00:24:16.860
Next time on A Channel: Aliens.

00:24:16.860 --> 00:24:20.550
It's said they were destroyed by a three-headed dragon!

00:24:20.550 --> 00:24:22.790
That were the Venusians.
